│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The shared parameters reduce overfitting and improve robustness on hard samples.          │
│                          │ Parametrized two-qubit gates provide more trainable degrees of freedom per gate. Enhanced │
│                          │ connectivity allows the circuit to learn more complex decision boundaries needed for      │
│                          │ difficult samples.                                                                        │
