│                          │ parameter efficiency. This targets the primary scoring criterion: robust worst-case       │
│                          │ separation.                                                                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The change increases n_distinct_params from 9 to 11 (still very efficient) but should     │
│                          │ significantly improve worst_group_margin by allowing the circuit to learn different       │
│                          │ rotation strategies for different qubit sets.                                             │
