│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ replace_fixed_cz_with_crz_entangling                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ The current program uses 13 fixed CZ gates with no trainable parameters in the entangling │
│                          │ block, limiting expressivity. Program 2 achieved the best score (0.66) by replacing Ising │
│                          │ gates with CRZ gates, which are parametrized controlled-rotation gates offering better    │
│                          │ control over two-qubit interactions.                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit replaces the fixed CZ entangling structure with parametrized CRZ gates using    │
│                          │ aggressive parameter sharing. We group the CRZ gates into two entangling blocks with      │
│                          │ shared parameters (ent_crzA, ent_crzB), which:                                            │
│                          │ 1. Adds trainability to two-qubit interactions                                            │
│                          │ 2. Reduces distinct parameters (from 9 to ~7)                                             │
│                          │ 3. Improves worst_group_margin by giving the optimizer more control                       │
│                          │ 4. Speeds up convergence (critical for small training sets)                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The pattern maintains the nearest-neighbor and mid-range connectivity that was successful │
│                          │ in Program 2.                                                                             │
