│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ skip3_crz_boost                                                                           │
│ patch_description        │ The current program achieves a solid score of 0.66 with excellent accuracy (1.0           │
│                          │ train/test, 0.99 val) but has a **worst_group_margin of only 0.35**, which is the key     │
│                          │ bottleneck. The validation_margin is 0.73, showing a large gap between average and        │
│                          │ worst-case performance.                                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The recommendation to add a "skip-3" CZ sublayer after the long-range CRZ block is        │
│                          │ well-motivated:                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. It directly targets worst-group margin improvement by adding sparse skip-connection    │
│                          │ entanglement                                                                              │
│                          │ 2. It maintains parameter economy (all skip-3 CZ gates share a single new parameter       │
│                          │ "ent_skip3")                                                                              │
│                          │ 3. It doesn't significantly increase depth or gate count                                  │
│                          │ 4. The sparse pattern (distance-3 connections: 0-3, 1-4, 2-5, 3-6, 4-7) complements the   │
│                          │ existing CRZ layer                                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ By keeping n_distinct_params at 8 (adding only one new parameter), the                    │
│                          │ parameter_efficiency score remains competitive while specifically addressing the          │
│                          │ worst-case margin problem.                                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The new architecture:                                                                     │
│                          │ - Keeps all existing blocks that achieve high accuracy                                    │
│                          │ - Inserts skip-3 CZ gates after the CRZ block                                             │
│                          │ - All skip-3 gates share parameter "ent_skip3" for economy                                │
│                          │ - Expected to improve worst_group_margin from 0.35 towards 0.40+                          │
