│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ prepend_rx_layer                                                                          │
│ patch_description        │ Prepend a global RX rotation layer before the initial RY layer. This introduces an        │
│                          │ orthogonal rotation axis early in the circuit, enabling better initial feature separation │
│                          │ and potentially improving worst_group_margin (critical for robust separation on hard      │
│                          │ samples).                                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The RX layer uses a single shared parameter across all 8 qubits, adding only 1 new        │
│                          │ distinct parameter while providing an additional degree of freedom that's orthogonal to   │
│                          │ the subsequent RY rotations. This approach has driven expressivity gains in multi-phase   │
│                          │ ansätze while maintaining shallow, efficient circuits.                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This targets:                                                                             │
│                          │ 1. Improving worst_group_margin (currently 0.36) by providing better initial state        │
│                          │ preparation                                                                               │
│                          │ 2. Reducing convergence time by giving the optimizer more flexibility early               │
│                          │ 3. Maintaining or improving parameter efficiency (1 new param is negligible with 7        │
│                          │ existing)                                                                                 │
