│                          │ (separation of 4 qubits). This meso-scale entangling motif creates orthogonal             │
│                          │ connectivity patterns that dovetail with existing skip-3 CZs and long-range CRZ blocks,   │
│                          │ providing additional structure for discriminating hard samples at zero parameter cost.    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The skip-4 CZ pairs are: [0,4], [1,5], [2,6], [3,7]. These create long-range entanglement │
│                          │ orthogonal to the skip-3 pattern and should improve robustness on difficult validation    │
│                          │ groups without increasing trainable parameters.                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
