│                          │ worst_group_margin (0.33) is much lower than validation_margin (0.71), indicating the     │
│                          │ classifier needs sharper gradients for difficult samples. The opposite diagonal pairs     │
│                          │ complement the existing [0,3], [1,4], [2,5], [4,7] diagonals and follow the               │
│                          │ recommendation to add these specific wrap-around gates.                                   │
