╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ rz_mid_dual_phase                                                                         │
│ patch_description        │ The current program achieves 0.65 combined score with a critical bottleneck:              │
│                          │ worst_group_margin_mean of 0.34 (compared to 0.36 in prior programs) and                  │
│                          │ convergence_step_mean of 60 (double the prior 30). The key issue is that the intermediate │
│                          │ phase modulation is insufficient to discriminate hard samples.                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ **Key parameters identified:**                                                            │
│                          │ - `ry_mid`: only provides single-axis rotation after entanglement                         │
│                          │ - `rz_final`: global final rotation but applied uniformly                                 │
│                          │ - `ent_crx`: adds one extra parameter (8 distinct vs 7 prior)                             │
│                          │ - Convergence slow: suggests circuit lacks expressivity in critical sample regions        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ **New strategy:**                                                                         │
│                          │ Following the recommendation to add RZ gates immediately after RY mid gates with a new    │
│                          │ shared parameter `rz_mid`, I introduce dual-phase modulation on odd wires. This exploits  │
│                          │ the non-commutativity of RY→RZ bracketing to create richer phase space exploration        │
│                          │ WITHOUT adding distinct parameters to the bottleneck. By inserting RZ rotations right     │
│                          │ after the intermediate RY gates on wires [1,3,5,7], the circuit gains geometric           │
│                          │ expressivity that specifically targets worst-group discrimination.                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This approach:                                                                            │
│                          │ 1. Maintains 8 distinct parameters (not 7, but reduces parameter count by removing one    │
│                          │ less-useful entangling gate)                                                              │
│                          │ 2. Improves worst_group_margin by leveraging phase-space non-commutativity                │
│                          │ 3. Accelerates convergence through more direct hard-sample access paths                   │
│                          │ 4. Replaces the slower CRX with fixed single-qubit phase sculpting                        │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0144                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5                                                     │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 7; deleted: 0; modified: 6;                                                        │
