│ patch_description        │ Insert a second narrow CRX triad immediately after the YY block, using the same `ent_nn`  │
│                          │ parameter. This mirrors the successful pattern from the prior best performer (0.67 score) │
│                          │ which had a CRX triad between XX and YY.                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The additional CRX layer after YY provides:                                               │
│                          │ 1. Richer controlled entanglement patterns without new parameters                         │
│                          │ 2. Better discrimination of hard samples (worst_group_margin improvement)                 │
│                          │ 3. Maintains parameter economy (still 7 distinct parameters)                              │
│                          │ 4. Leverages the XX→CRX→YY→CRX backbone that showed strong results                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This targets the primary weakness: worst_group_margin_mean (0.35→0.36) by adding          │
