                         Patch Metadata - Gen 48/80 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 1/2                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ remove-duplicate-motif-add-zz-enrichment                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ The current program has depth 39 and shows degraded performance (score 0.66) compared to  │
│                          │ the prior best (0.67 with depth 26). The doubled motif structure added complexity without │
│                          │ improving worst_group_margin or validation accuracy.                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit removes the inefficient second motif repetition and instead adds a minimal ZZ   │
│                          │ sublayer immediately after the CRX gates in the first motif. The ZZ gates act on the same │
│                          │ nearest-neighbor pairs (0-1, 2-3, 4-5, 6-7) with the shared "ent_nn" parameter,           │
│                          │ complementing the X-Y Ising interactions with Z-axis entanglement. This approach:         │
│                          │ - Restores depth closer to the prior best (saving ~13 gates)                              │
│                          │ - Adds targeted expressivity without full motif duplication                               │
│                          │ - Maintains parameter economy (no new distinct parameters)                                │
│                          │ - Reuses proven architectural principles                                                  │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0166                                                                                   │
