│ patch_description        │ Replace the CRZ gate acting on qubits [2, 5] with CRY under the "ent_lr" parameter. This  │
│                          │ adds Y-axis controlled rotation diversity to the long-range entangling block, which       │
│                          │ currently relies entirely on Z-axis (CRZ). The axis diversification should help the       │
│                          │ circuit learn better feature separations for the hardest validation samples, improving    │
