│ patch_description        │ The current program repeats the entire entanglement motif twice, which increases          │
│                          │ complexity (150 gates, depth 39) without improving worst-group margin (0.35 vs prior best │
│                          │ 0.36). The key recommendation is to complete the CRX ring by adding the cyclic edge [7,0] │
│                          │ under parameter "ent_nn", which was shown in generation 41 to boost margins without extra │
│                          │ parameters.                                                                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Strategy:                                                                                 │
│                          │ 1. Remove the redundant second motif (XX, CRX, YY, CRZ blocks) to return to a simpler,    │
│                          │ more generalizable structure                                                              │
│                          │ 2. Add the cyclic CRX closure {"gate":"CRX","wires":[7,0],"param":"ent_nn"} immediately   │
│                          │ after the first CRX enrichment layer                                                      │
│                          │ 3. This completes the nearest-neighbor CRX ring and should improve worst-group margin     │
│                          │ through better cyclic entanglement connectivity                                           │
│                          │ 4. Result: ~100 gates, depth ~20, single motif, cyclic completeness                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This addresses the core bottleneck (worst-group margin) by improving the expressivity of  │
│                          │ the narrow-CRX layer while reducing overall complexity and improving generalization.      │
