│                          │ 2. **Inspiration program** (81 gates, depth 20): Uses selective RZ on even qubits only (4 │
│                          │ gates instead of 8), reducing parameter count while maintaining performance.              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 3. **Second prior** (93 gates, depth 20): Uses all-qubit RZ final layer (8 gates),        │
│                          │ slightly higher gate count than inspiration.                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The scoring heavily penalizes parameter count and gate efficiency. The inspiration        │
│                          │ program achieves the best gate efficiency (81 gates) while maintaining all performance    │
│                          │ metrics.                                                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The crossover strategy:                                                                   │
│                          │ - **Keep** the efficient final layer from the inspiration program (RZ on even qubits:     │
│                          │ 0,2,4,6)                                                                                  │
│                          │ - **Keep** the base entanglement structure (XX, YY, CRZ blocks) which is proven and       │
│                          │ efficient                                                                                 │
│                          │ - **Remove** the CRX layer added in the current program, as it increases depth/gates      │
│                          │ without improving worst_group_margin (0.36 vs 0.35)                                       │
│                          │ - **Maintain** the parameter sharing scheme (6 distinct parameters)                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This returns to the inspiration program's lean architecture while preserving the proven   │
│                          │ structure that achieves 0.68 score with minimal gate overhead.                            │
