│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ crx_offset_entangling                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the offset nearest-neighbor YY gates in the second entangling block with CRX      │
│                          │ gates. This change is motivated by:                                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Prior generation (Gen 48) showed a 0.66→0.67 score improvement when CRX enriched the   │
│                          │ entangling subspace                                                                       │
│                          │ 2. CRX gates provide controlled rotation with better expressiveness for binary            │
│                          │ classification                                                                            │
│                          │ 3. Maintains the eight-gate structure but diversifies gate types to accelerate            │
│                          │ convergence                                                                               │
│                          │ 4. Preserves parameter sharing by using a common "ent_off" parameter for all three CRX    │
│                          │ gates                                                                                     │
│                          │ 5. This should improve worst_group_margin (currently 0.35) by providing better decision   │
│                          │ boundaries                                                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The change replaces:                                                                      │
│                          │ - YY gates on (1,2), (3,4), (5,6) pairs                                                   │
│                          │ - With CRX gates using the same parameter sharing                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Expected impact: Improved robust separation on hard samples, moving closer to the 0.68    │
│                          │ achieved by simpler prior designs.                                                        │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0099                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
