│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ add_even_wire_ry_mid_bracketing                                                           │
│ patch_description        │ The prior program 1 achieved worst_group_margin of 0.36 by adding RY intermediate         │
│                          │ rotations on even wires with the "ry_mid" parameter before the final RZ layer. This       │
│                          │ creates a symmetric bracketing pattern on all qubits that sharpens the decision boundary. │
│                          │ The current program lacks this even-wire bracketing, which may explain the slightly lower │
│                          │ worst_group_margin (0.35) and higher convergence steps (60 vs 30).                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Adding RY("ry_mid") gates on wires {0, 2, 4, 6} immediately before the final RZ layer     │
│                          │ will:                                                                                     │
│                          │ - Restore the symmetric bracketing pattern proven effective in prior program 1            │
│                          │ - Improve worst_group_margin without increasing distinct parameters (ry_mid is already    │
│                          │ used)                                                                                     │
│                          │ - Potentially reduce convergence steps by providing clearer feature rotation              │
│                          │ - Maintain parameter efficiency while improving robustness on hard samples                │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0117                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5                                                     │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 6; deleted: 0; modified: 0;                                                        │
